OL,3,AOne million UK people who have never
OL,4,Asmoked are now vaping
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than a million people who say they
OL,7,Fhave never tried a cigarette are now
OL,8,Fvapers, latest UK data for 2025 reveals
OL,9,F- up from around 940,000 in 2024.
OL,11,FPeople aged 25-35 are vaping more than
OL,12,Fany others, overtaking 16 to
OL,13,F24-year-olds, with 16.4% using
OL,14,Fe-cigarettes daily or occasionally.
OL,16,FFor the second year in a row, more
OL,17,Fover-16s are using vapes or
OL,18,Fe-cigarettes than smoking cigarettes,
OL,19,Faccording to the Office for National
OL,20,FStatistics (ONS).
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
