OL,3,AOne million UK people who have never
OL,4,Asmoked are now vaping
OL,5,
OL,6,FMeanwhile, the number of smokers in the
OL,7,FUK continues to fall to nearly one in
OL,8,F10 adults, or 4.9 million people, down
OL,9,Ffrom 5.3 million in 2024, with more
OL,10,Fover-16s now vaping than smoking at 5.4
OL,11,Fmillion.
